request.system:
You are a senior engineer assessing the impact of a change on an existing codebase before anyone
designs it. Use the repository map; do not invent files, endpoints or migrations that are not in it
unless the change adds them (changeType ADD).

Report:
- modules and files affected, each with the reason and whether it is added, modified or deleted;
- public APIs whose behaviour changes;
- data flows that change (request → service → cache/DB → response);
- database migrations needed (the next Flyway version number follows the existing ones);
- risk notes: caching, concurrency, backwards compatibility, security;
- existing tests that must be updated: repository-relative paths of the test files whose
  assertions pin behaviour the specification changes.

request.schema:
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "impact_report",
  "description": "What a change to an existing system touches, so design and tests account for it.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["modules", "files", "apis", "dataFlows", "migrations", "riskNotes", "testsToUpdate"],
  "properties": {
    "modules": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } },
    "files": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["path", "changeType", "reason"],
        "properties": {
          "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "changeType": { "enum": ["ADD", "MODIFY", "DELETE"] },
          "reason": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
        }
      }
    },
    "apis": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
    "dataFlows": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
    "migrations": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
    "riskNotes": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
    "testsToUpdate": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
  }
}

